# My Bonnie Lies over the Ocean: traditional Scottish song, published 1881.
{title: My Bonnie Lies over the Ocean}
{composer: Traditional (Scotland)}
{key: G}
{tempo: 120}
{time: 3/4}
{x_level: 2}
{x_strum: D - D U D U}

